---
layout: base.njk
title: The Brooklyn Dispatch
description: Essays and recommendations on films, books, music and the places they lead.
permalink: /
---

{% set latestShelf = collections.shelf | reverse | first %}

<section class="home-hero home-hero--editorial wrap">

  <div class="home-hero__copy">

    <h1>The places they lead.</h1>

    <p>
      Essays and recommendations exploring where films,
      books and music continue after the final page, frame or note.
    </p>

    <div class="home-hero__feature">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        Featured Essay
      </div>

      <h2>
        <a href="/film/minotaur-the-coldest-film-at-cannes/">
          Minotaur: The Coldest Film at Cannes
        </a>
      </h2>

      <p>
        Andrey Zvyagintsev's Grand Prix winner is a masterclass in precision,
        restraint and trust.
      </p>

      <a class="text-link" href="/film/minotaur-the-coldest-film-at-cannes/">
        Read essay →
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


{% if latestShelf %}

<section class="home-section home-section--shelf">

  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="section-heading">

      <div>

        <div class="eyebrow">
          The Shelf
        </div>

        <h2>
          {{ latestShelf.data.month }} {{ latestShelf.data.year }}
        </h2>

      </div>

      <a class="text-link" href="{{ latestShelf.url }}">
        One film. One book. One album. One venue. View the Shelf →
      </a>

    </div>

    <div class="home-shelf-grid">

      {% for pick in latestShelf.data.picks %}

        <a class="home-shelf-card" href="{{ latestShelf.url }}">

          <img
            src="{{ pick.image }}"
            alt="{{ pick.alt }}"
            class="home-shelf-card__image">

          <span class="meta-label">
            {{ pick.category }}
          </span>

          <h3>

            {% if pick.category != "Place" %}
              <em>{{ pick.title }}</em>
            {% else %}
              {{ pick.title }}
            {% endif %}

            {% if pick.year %}
              <span class="home-shelf-year">
                ({{ pick.year }})
              </span>
            {% endif %}

          </h3>

          <span class="home-shelf-card__creator">
            {{ pick.creator }}
          </span>

        </a>

      {% endfor %}

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

{% endif %}


{% include "newsletter.njk" %}


<section class="home-section home-section--about">

  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="about-preview">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        The Brooklyn Dispatch
      </div>

      <h2>
        Films. Books. Music. The places they lead.
      </h2>

      <p>
        The Brooklyn Dispatch exists because films, books and music rarely
        end with their final page, frame or note. The most interesting part
        is often where they lead next.
      </p>

      <a class="text-link" href="/about/">
        About the Dispatch →
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>